[en.FOCUS_C15_CANTERLOT_PACT]
The Canterlot Pact

[en.FOCUS_C15_CANTERLOT_PACT_desc]
Cozy Glow, Queen Chrysalis, and Lord Tirek, known as the “Big Three”, defeated M6 in the Ultimate Battle, and then they went on to defeat the resistance forces all over Equestria. After more than a year of war, the “Big Three” returned to Canterlot and signed the Canterlot Pact, which established the new order after the war. The Pact explicitly divided the jurisdiction of the “Big Three”: Cozy Glow would establish the Equestria Empire and become the Empress; Queen Chrysalis would revert the changelings back to its original un-hatched state, restore the rule and expand the territory of the Changeling Empire; and Lord Tirek would lead the centaurs to take over the Griffonica continent.\nHowever, according to informed sources, the negotiation process of the Canterlot Pact was not easy. The “Big Three” argued incessantly during the week-long meeting, and even almost came to blows. Nevertheless, the three eventually reached a consensus and presented a united front to the outside world, declaring the arrival of a new era in the world of Equestria.

[zh.FOCUS_C15_CANTERLOT_PACT]
《坎特洛特协定》

[zh.FOCUS_C15_CANTERLOT_PACT_desc]
和煦光流，邪茧女王与提雷克大王——史称“三巨头”——在终末之战中击败M6后，乘胜进军逐个击破了各个地方、各个种族的抵抗势力。在经过一年多的征战后，“三巨头”再次回到了坎特洛特，签署规定战后新秩序的《坎特洛特协定》。协定明确了“三巨头”各自的统辖范围：和煦光流将成立小马利亚帝国并登基成为帝国女皇；邪茧女王使幻形灵种族恢复到此前的未化茧状态，恢复统治并扩张了幻形灵帝国的领地；提雷克则将率领半人马族接管狮鹫大陆。\n\n然而，据知情人士透露，《坎特洛特协定》的商议过程并不容易，“三巨头”在为期一周的会议中争吵不休，甚至险些大打出手——无论如何，三者最终还是达成了一致，以团结的姿态向外界宣示了小马利亚世界新时代的到来。

